# Summon
#
# Exemplar lens: how a surface here loads a latent region compactly.
# A lens is an attentional substrate — enough named tension that a model
# ingesting it inhabits the region, without reading the crystal.
# First specimen: the stark-kill excavation.

#>spw_lens_summon
#:lens #!attentional_substrate

^"how_to_summon"{
  ~#move: "name the region, its valence, its live tension, its forbidden shortcut — nothing else"
  ~#density: "a lens should fit in one screen; if it scrolls, it is documentation wearing a costume"
  ~#mutability: "lenses are for ideation — bend them, fork them, contradict them; the crystal keeps the truth"
}

^"lens: stark_kill"{
  ~#region: "the hand AIRs in circuit/src — stark.rs has already fallen; the constellation around it remains"
  @canon: ~"../../metatheory"
  @debt: ~"../../circuit"
  ~#valence: "bone" // load-bearing, calcified, scheduled for principled demolition
  ~#tension: "every hand AIR compiles green and proves nothing; the ladder is Rung 1 functional → Rung 2 semantic → Rung 3 fold → apex"
  ~#forbidden: "extending a Rust AIR because it is right there — that is the drift, not the work"
  ?["What would this circuit look like if it had been born in Lean?"]{
    #:ideation #!schizophrenic_ok
    $%[air.constraint_shape, refinement.rung] => ~#rederivation_sketch
  }
}
